title ALES163 — Lotus's stereo_limit_env: the attack/release brickwall limiter carried into stereo, the linked envelope driving one linked ceiling over time
prompt Keep going Lindy-first crux-first on the Lotus (ALES) ladder; approve my own design rounds; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at the custody gates.
think ALES162 carried the gate into stereo over time; this rung takes the second of the three mechanical siblings ALES161 opened: the attack/release brickwall limiter carried into stereo, the gain reduction following the linked envelope rather than pinning the bare pair the instant it crosses the ceiling. It is the compressor's linked gain at an infinite ratio — the envelope's target pinned to the ceiling, no ratio knob. The mono family crossed this seam at ALES55, completing its breathing trio over ALES52's envelope.
think The shape spends both proofs: advance ONE shared envelope toward the linked peak by ALES160's stereo_env_step; within the ceiling both pass; above it the single gain ceil/e (in (0,1)) applied to BOTH raw samples. On the above-ceiling branch e > ceil >= 1, so the divide is always safe — the zero-envelope case the gate faced cannot arise here.
think The crux LINK: under unit attack+release the linked envelope is the instantaneous linked peak, so stereo_limit_env reduces to ALES158's memoryless stereo_limit byte for byte on both — the time-varying rung's zero-smoothing limit is exactly the memoryless rung already proven.
obs GREEN first run — the ALES162 lesson (design the left-always-peak test so the shared envelope and the independent right envelope genuinely diverge) carried over: a loud left holds the shared envelope high while the right's own envelope tracks a quieter curve, so the linked right scales on a different fraction than mono limit_env(right).
obs Six laws GREEN on metal: the instantaneous law (== stereo_limit under unit coeffs on both); the linked-gain-over-time law (a left-always-peak master has left' == ALES55 mono limit_env(left), the right scaled by the same fraction, the independent reduction differing); the image law (out-of-phase pair returns still out of phase); the knob/no-lookahead law (below-ceiling identity, a slower attack overshoots — honest no-lookahead — an instant attack pins the peak-holder exactly on the ceiling); the carry law (split == whole on both); the sub-ceiling/silence/balance/atomicity(four refusals)/degenerate law.
obs StereoLimitEnvError = limit_env.LimitEnvError reused whole; the fusion adds no fault. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; gain ceil/e in (0,1), no overflow (i64). No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round.
